## CALCULATE THE WEIGHTED SCORE AUTOMATICALLY

Formula:

Final Score =
(Pedagogik Score × 0.40)
+
(Dampak Score × 0.35)
+
(Video Score × 0.25)

Example:

Pedagogik = 85.

Dampak = 90.

Video = 80.

Final Score = 85.50.

The total possible score is 100.

Display the weighted score prominently and update it immediately when inputs change.

Use decimal precision internally and display two decimal places.

